   encoders 1.5 ms apart before it uses the reading of the unit, which is
   then 2.4 to 3.55 ms old:

     Typing error: Variable `fresh` is unboxed with grade `[2.4, 3.55]`
       accumulated since it was bound, which is not below its box grade
       `[0, 2]`
       ...
       Note: the resource inequality `[2.4, 3.55] <= [0, 2]` does not hold
*)
(*
